			"Message": "chore(Land): Advance Element submodule — Eliminate Air module wrappers\n\nAdvance the Element submodule pointer to 9ccc3638, completing the Air integration layer migration.\n\nMountain removes the dead `AirServiceTypesStub` re-export module and consolidates `AirClient.rs` to retain only the `MapAirError` translation boundary and type alias. The `DEFAULT_AIR_SERVER_ADDRESS` constant is now referenced directly from `::AirLibrary::Client::AirClient` in `GetAirAddress.rs` rather than via the local wrapper.\n\nThis finishes the absolute-path delegation pattern across all IPC boundaries. Mountain's Air surface is now a pure error-translation layer with no local re-exports.",
